OL,3,ARussian man linked to deadly London
OL,4,Ahospitals hack arrested
OL,5,
OL,6,FGerman police have detained a Russian
OL,7,Fman accused of being part of a
OL,8,Fcyber-crime gang which caused chaos at
OL,9,FLondon hospitals and contributed to a
OL,10,Fpatient's death.
OL,12,FThe hack of blood testing company
OL,13,FSynnovis in 2024 led to disrupted
OL,14,Fpathology services across several
OL,15,FLondon hospitals and was the first
OL,16,Fcyber attack in history to be directly
OL,17,Flinked to a death.
OL,19,FThe BBC can confirm German detectives
OL,20,Fare now including the incident in their
OL,21,Finvestigation into the detained Russian
OL,22,Fand his associates.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/18
