OL,3,ASean 'Diddy' Combs moved to
OL,4,Alow-security facility in Pennsylvania
OL,5,
OL,6,FSean "Diddy" Combs has been transferred
OL,7,Ffrom a New Jersey correctional facility
OL,8,Fto a prison in Pennsylvania, the US
OL,9,FFederal Bureau of Prisons says.
OL,11,FThe rap mogul was moved to FCI
OL,12,FAllenwood Low on Friday, a prison
OL,13,Fofficial said, but declined to discuss
OL,14,Fwhy he was moved, citing privacy,
OL,15,Fsafety, and security reasons.
OL,17,F"His transfer from one low-security
OL,18,Ffacility to another is an important
OL,19,Fdistinction," Combs' spokesman told the
OL,20,FBBC, adding that the move "is
OL,21,Fconsistent with a decision made with
OL,22,Fsafety and security in mind".
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/18
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
