OL,3,ADame Judi Dench joins Archers
OL,4,ABirmingham campaign
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 100 current and former cast
OL,7,Fand crew members of The Archers,
OL,8,Fincluding Dame Judi Dench, have called
OL,9,Fon the BBC to keep the programme in
OL,10,FBirmingham.
OL,12,FThe appeal follows a decision to shelve
OL,13,Fplans for a dedicated studio at the
OL,14,Fbroadcaster's new Digbeth headquarters.
OL,16,FSupporters say recording the drama
OL,17,Felsewhere could affect its quality and
OL,18,Ffuture.
OL,20,FThe BBC says the move is part of wider
OL,21,Fcost-saving measures and alternative
OL,22,Foptions are being explored.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/18
